                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.installAsync(sources, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "installAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong> <strong><code>Overload 2/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>sources</strong> { <a href=\"#installsource\">InstallSource</a>[] }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#installoptions\">InstallOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> } - 兑现值为 <a href=\"#installresult\">InstallResult</a>[]</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#m-install\">install</a> 的异步形态. 参数错误也通过 Promise 拒绝报告. 来源和选项在调用线程中立即形成快照, 之后修改原数组或对象不会改变本次请求.</p>\n",
