        {
          "textRaw": "[m] session",
          "name": "[m]_session",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.session(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "session",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>source</strong> { <a href=\"#installsource\">InstallSource</a> | <a href=\"#installsource\">InstallSource</a>[] }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#installoptions\">InstallOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#installsession\">InstallSession</a> } - 已开始执行的安装会话</li>\n</ul>\n<p>监听器应在取得会话后立即注册. 会话的 <code>complete</code>, <code>result</code> 和 <code>wait</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-install\">install</a> 保持相同的单项或数组结果形状. 会话对象只能在创建它的脚本线程上访问.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let startChosen = source =&gt; {\n    let session = installer.session(source);\n    session.on(&#39;progress&#39;, (progress, detail) =&gt; {\n        console.log(progress, detail.bytesWritten, detail.totalBytes);\n    }).on(&#39;complete&#39;, result =&gt; console.log(result))\n        .on(&#39;error&#39;, error =&gt; console.error(error.code, error.systemMessage));\n    return session;\n};\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] session"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] uninstall",
          "name": "[m]_uninstall",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.uninstall(packageName, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "uninstall",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>packageName</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 要卸载的应用包名</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#uninstalloptions\">UninstallOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#uninstallresult\">UninstallResult</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过插件卸载应用. Shizuku 或 Root 可用于静默卸载, <code>none</code> 使用系统确认界面. <code>keepData</code> 和目标用户选项需要相应特权能力. 系统应用保护, 设备管理员和用户策略仍可阻止卸载.</p>\n<p><a href=\"app#m-uninstall\">app.uninstall</a> 保持原有的系统卸载意图行为, 无需此插件, 也不提供本方法的安装器结果与特权选项.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
