        {
          "textRaw": "[p+] authorizer",
          "name": "[p+]_authorizer",
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.authorizer.available",
              "name": "installer.authorizer.available",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Getter</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a>[] }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回插件报告为可用的授权方式, 取值来自 <code>&#39;none&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;shizuku&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;root&#39;</code>, 不包含 <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code>. &quot;可用&quot; 不等于服务已运行或已经授权, 需结合 <code>state</code> 查看. 此列表不表示插件设置中的自动选择优先级.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "installer.authorizer.available"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.authorizer.state(name?)",
              "name": "installer.authorizer.state(name?)",
              "desc": "<ul>\n<li><strong>[ name = &#39;auto&#39; ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;none&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;shizuku&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;root&#39;</code></li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#authorizerstate\">AuthorizerState</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>查询状态, 不请求新的授权. <code>auto</code> 返回聚合状态: 任一路径可用则 <code>available</code> 为 <code>true</code>; 任一可用路径正在运行则 <code>running</code> 为 <code>true</code>; 任一可用且正在运行的路径已获授权则 <code>granted</code> 为 <code>true</code>. 它不暴露插件自定义的选择顺序, 也不承诺下一次安装一定采用某个特权路径.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "installer.authorizer.state(name?)"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.authorizer.request(name, timeout?)",
              "name": "installer.authorizer.request(name,_timeout?)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>name</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - <code>&#39;auto&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;none&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;shizuku&#39;</code> 或 <code>&#39;root&#39;</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ timeout = 300000 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 等待超时, 毫秒, 取值为 1 至 7200000 的整数</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 请求结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>显式选择 <code>shizuku</code> 或 <code>root</code> 时请求对应授权. 拒绝, 不可用和超时可通过相应 <code>InstallerError</code> 报告. <code>auto</code> 只检查是否已有可用, 运行中且已授权的路径, 不主动发起 Shizuku 或 Root 的新授权提示.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "installer.authorizer.request(name, timeout?)"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "installer.authorizer.requestAsync(name, timeout?)",
              "name": "installer.authorizer.requestasync(name,_timeout?)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>name</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ timeout = 300000 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a> } - 兑现值为 <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>request</code> 的异步形态.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "installer.authorizer.requestAsync(name, timeout?)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p+] authorizer"
        },
        {
